* Lumina Industrial Cyber-Physical Automation Systems - Singulation Core Architecture
* FUNCTION_BLOCK: FB_ParcelSingulator_SteerableWheelArray
* DOMAIN: High-Speed Automated Parcel Singulator: Vision-Guided Steerable Wheel Array 
