*
* ARCHITECTURAL SPECIFICATION:
*   - Target Throughput Capacity: Up to 14,000 parcels/hour (continuous cross-dock sorting)
*   - Actuation Topology: 2D Matrix of individually steerable servomotor-driven drive rollers
*   - Kinematic Formulation: Non-holonomic multi-body parcel trajectory control with friction-limit
*     slip prevention (Coulomb-Euler friction boundary projection).
*   - Sensor Fusion: Triple Modular Redundancy (2oo3) voter over three asynchronous 3D LiDAR/vision
*     triangulation systems with sub-millimeter centroid and orientation tracking.
*   - Gap Control Strategy: Receding Horizon Model Predictive Control (MPC) with real-time state-space
*     gradient descent optimization for downstream singulated pitch alignment.
*   - Safety & Fault Tolerance: SIL-3 / Cat 4 EN ISO 13849-1 architecture with 2oo3 voting, continuous
*     residual health metrics, thermal/torque slip detection, and deterministic graceful degradation.
